msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/disk-troubleshooting.rst:62
#: dd41ab61e1de4fdda98d2dda6dcb8e1a
msgid ""
"Use ``sudo lvremove qubes_dom0/<name>`` to remove backup copies of some less "
"important VMs – entries with ``-back`` in their name."
